Politics.detail:
Replace Schumer argues that Schumer cannot be the face of democratic leadership. Schumer has failed to provide basic leadership. New Leadership argues that Current leaders must step aside. Rank-and-file Democrats must influence new leaders. Unclear theory of change without new leaders.

@thehellcurve.bsky.social: “I don't know how you get like this. Schumer is a known quantity. It's not like everyone's shitting on him because he's never been majority leader. He's sucked for years. Do any of you follow politics this team sports shit is going to destroy the country.”

Replace Schumer (90.7%) says Schumer is unfit to lead Democrats. New Leadership (9.3%) says Leadership change is necessary.

Business.detail:
