@dmnd.me: “If they’re really planning to merge Tesla and SpaceX, that’s steel that could be going towards rockets and rocket infrastructure”

Cybertruck Canceled (80%) says Tesla ends Cybertruck production. Tesla Subsidies (20%) says Taxpayers fund Tesla through government contracts.

